        <mxCell id="tds_srv" value="THREDDS Data Server (TDS 5.8)&#xa;[Port 8080 - Docker Container: sih_tds]&#xa;• ncWMS 1.3.0 Dynamic Layer Server&#xa;• CRS:84 Coordinate Axis Order Lock&#xa;• TIME &amp; ELEVATION 4D Slicing&#xa;• Palettes: psu-magma, viridis, rainbow&#xa;• GetCapabilities / GetMap / GetLegendGraphic&#xa;• OPeNDAP &amp; WCS Endpoints" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c4a6e;strokeColor=#38bdf8;fontColor=#f0f9ff;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="grp_backend">
