        <mxCell id="plot_modal" value="Plotly.js Scientific Validation Profile Modal&#xa;• Multi-Parameter Vertical Ocean Axis (Depth 0 - 2000m, Reversed Y-Axis)&#xa;• Simultaneous Parameter Traces: Temp (°C), Salinity (PSU), Chlorophyll-a (mg/m³), Currents (m/s)&#xa;• Ground-Truth Observed Points (Solid) vs. Collocated Model Reanalysis (Dashed)&#xa;• Live Model Accuracy Header Banner: Displays Real Mean Absolute Error (MAE)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#064e3b;strokeColor=#10b981;fontColor=#ecfdf5;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="sub_analytics">
