        <mxCell id="tour_panel" value="Dual-Mode Scientific Outreach Engine (Guided Narrative Tour)&#xa;• Mode Switch: Operational Forecaster Mode &lt;==&gt; Public Educational Tour Mode&#xa;• 5-Beat Scientific Storyline of Super Cyclone Amphan:&#xa;  1. Warm Pool Incubator (SST &gt; 31°C)  2. Rapid Intensification Peak  3. Landfall at Sundarbans&#xa;  4. Ocean Cold Wake Upwelling (CTA to 3D Volume)  5. Phytoplankton Bloom (CTA to BGC-Argo #2902264)&#xa;• Automated Camera Flight Choreography with Narrative Overlays" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#701a75;strokeColor=#f472b6;fontColor=#fdf2f8;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="sub_analytics">
